Package: qualembed
Type: Package
Title: Embedding-Based Semantic Measurement and Calibration for Survey and Qualitative Text
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("FIRSTNAME", "LASTNAME", email = "psycholo.studio@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A thin, auditable toolkit for measuring the meaning of nominal and
    narrative survey responses in the semantic space of large language model
    (LLM) embedding APIs. Provides a unified interface to Gemini, Voyage AI,
    and OpenAI embedding endpoints, and the calibration statistics of the
    accompanying paper: permutation-tested within-between contrasts, Ward
    clustering with adjusted Rand indices, Mantel congruence of similarity
    structures, Procrustes alignment with per-item residuals, and
    theory-anchored semantic projection. Pure R: no Python, no GPU, no model
    training.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/PsycholoStudio/qualembed
BugReports: https://github.com/PsycholoStudio/qualembed/issues
